{"version":1,"width":1080,"height":1350,"html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"nl\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"loveke-size\" content=\"1080x1350\">\n<title>Cadeaukaart</title>\n<style>/* Loveke Instagram-huisstijl. Lettertypes lokaal (fontsource), geen netwerk nodig. */\n@font-face{font-family:'Lilita One';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/lilita-one-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-400-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:400}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'DM Sans';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/dm-sans-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-600-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:600}\n@font-face{font-family:'Caveat';src:url(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/instagram/fonts/caveat-latin-700-normal.woff2\") format('woff2');font-weight:700}\n:root{--cream:#FFF8F0;--black:#1A1A1A;--orange:#FF7033;--yellow:#FFD43D;--red:#E3404B;--pink:#FF85A1}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0}\n.wm{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E3404B 0%,#FF7033 55%,#FFC93D 100%);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}\n.dots{background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(26,26,26,.10) 2.5px,transparent 2.5px);background-size:22px 22px}\n/* Plek voor een Instagram-sticker (poll, link, vraag, aftelling): leeg in de export. */\n.slot{visibility:hidden}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div style=\"width: 1080px; height: 1350px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FF7033; position: relative; overflow: hidden; font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; color: #1A1A1A\">\n<div class=\"dots\" style=\"position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: .55\"></div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 70px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 112px; line-height: .95; color: #1A1A1A\" data-slot=\"titel\" data-label=\"Titel\" data-max=\"24\">Het enige cadeau</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 182px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 112px; line-height: .95; color: #FFF8F0; -webkit-text-stroke: 5px #1A1A1A; text-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #1A1A1A\" data-slot=\"subtitel\" data-label=\"Subtitel\" data-max=\"24\">dat altijd past.</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 190px; top: 350px; width: 700px; height: 700px; overflow: hidden; border: 6px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 28px; box-shadow: 14px 14px 0 #1A1A1A; background: #FFFFFF; transform: rotate(-2deg)\">\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Akke-aigento/loveke/main/marketing/product-photos/cadeaukaart-1.png\" alt=\"Loveke-cadeaukaarten in verschillende kleuren\" style=\"position: absolute; width: 760px; left: -30px; top: -20px; max-width: none; display: block\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 50px; top: 900px; background: #FFD43D; border: 5px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 #1A1A1A; padding: 10px 22px; transform: rotate(-4deg); font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 40px\" data-slot=\"chip1\" data-label=\"Kenmerk 1\" data-max=\"30\">€5 tot €100, of eigen bedrag</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; right: 50px; top: 1010px; background: #FFF8F0; border: 5px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 #1A1A1A; padding: 10px 22px; transform: rotate(3deg); font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 40px\" data-slot=\"chip2\" data-label=\"Kenmerk 2\" data-max=\"30\">digitaal, meteen bruikbaar</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 120px; top: 1110px; background: #FF85A1; border: 5px solid #1A1A1A; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 #1A1A1A; padding: 10px 22px; transform: rotate(-2deg); font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 40px\" data-slot=\"chip3\" data-label=\"Kenmerk 3\" data-max=\"26\">2 jaar geldig</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; left: 70px; bottom: 50px; font-family: 'Caveat', cursive; font-weight: 700; font-size: 56px; color: #FFF8F0; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #1A1A1A\" data-slot=\"onderregel\" data-label=\"Onderregel\" data-max=\"40\">geen maat raden. geen kleur kiezen.</div>\n<div style=\"position: absolute; right: 60px; bottom: 44px; font-family: 'Lilita One', sans-serif; font-size: 52px; background: #1A1A1A; color: #FFF8F0; padding: 4px 22px; border-radius: 16px\">Loveke</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}